  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Beach Haven is a newly constructed 3 story home which boasts 4 inviting bedrooms, including a king bed, three queen beds, and a twin bed. Guests enjoy three pleasant bathrooms, each equipped with a shower and hair dryer for added comfort. A half bath is located on the first floor just off the common area. The house stays cozy with heating and cool with air conditioning, making it a nice retreat no matter the season. An iron is also available to keep your wardrobe fresh. Whether relaxing indoors or exploring nearby, guests find this delightful home a perfect base for their getaway. There are nearby grocery stores, restaurants and shopping. Feel free to reach out to us during your stay.<br><br>As you enter the home, the first floor brings you into a beautifully decorated living area. The kitchen is fully stocked with a gas stove and oven, refrigerator, microwave and a single cup/pot coffeemaker. A gas grill and an outdoor shower with hot and cold water sits at the back of house.<br><br>The second floor boast three bedrooms, in the master bedroom, you will find a king size bed with an en-suite bathroom, a walk-in shower, double vanities, toilet and closet make up this area. The remaining bedrooms on this floor are a bunk room with a queen bed and a twin bed and a queen bedroom. Both rooms share a full bathroom with a tub/shower combo. A washer/dryer are also on this floor.<br><br>The third floor offers a queen bedroom and a private full bathroom with a tub/shower combo.This floor also has a bonus room with a sectional for ample seating and a flat screen tv. Windows galore to create an open space.<br><br>We have free WiFi. Four bikes, six new Tommy Bahama beach chairs, beach towels and a cart to haul everything to the beach! Our wish is for you to have a wonderful vacation with many memories made with your family and friends. Cleanliness and a feeling of home is what we hope to accomplish.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Welcome to Beach Haven! Six new beach chairs! Beach wagon .5 mile to beach!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
